Deviations from the mock (recorded at card open, honored):
- No MB byte counts on the install line — EngineProgress carries percent or
  null, never bytes; inventing "132 MB of 293 MB" would fake progress.
- Stepper captions sit under the dots (the mock's shape); the horizontal
  one-line chip layout was replaced in the fix commit after capture vision
  QA showed dangling connectors at 390px.
- Observation (honest, not a defect): avatar variants hash from engine uuids,
  so some profile sets collapse toward one variant (the run hashed three
  ids to v3, one to v0 — variation >=2 held). Per-id stability across
  renders/reloads is the contract and is verified; forced pairwise
  distinctness would make the color a function of the roster, not the
  person, and was deliberately not done.
